<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- L.A. County MTA, Calif..</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- L.A. County MTA, Calif..</headline>
<text>
<p>LOS ANGELES COUNTY METROPOLITAN TRANSPORTATION</p>
<p>AUTHORITY, CALIFORNIA</p>
<p>RE: $256,870,000</p>
<p>PROPOSITION A FIRST TIER SENIOR SALES TAX</p>
<p>REVENUE REFUNDING BONDS SERIES 1997-A</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price</p>
<p>restrictions are removed</p>
<p>on the term bonds, and the bonds are now free to trade.</p>
